# Driver input added by the repair of 2026-10-30 (not from the repository).
# One installsPage entry, with no overlay:body: the original keeps it with
# body "" and fails on the body assertion ("body '' should end ..."). A
# pattern that requires overlay:body drops the entry; a body read widened to
# any predicate picks the targetResource, meta or title instead of "".
@prefix overlay: <https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/ontology/overlay#> .
@prefix dct:     <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/ontology/overlay#wiki-memory>
    a overlay:Overlay ;
    overlay:installsPage [
        overlay:targetResource </vault/wiki/concepts/how-wiki-memory-works.md> ;
        overlay:meta <concepts/how-wiki-memory-works.md.meta.ttl> ;
        dct:title "How Wiki-Memory Works"
    ] .
